<title>POLAND: RELPOL OCT NET RISES TO PLN 472,400.</title>
<headline>RELPOL OCT NET RISES TO PLN 472,400.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.47 vs   0.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.75 vs   0.80</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.42 vs   0.94</p>
<p> Sales		    3.75 vs   3.54</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     4.57 vs   4.09</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 6.88 vs   5.31</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.77 vs   6.44</p>
<p> Sales		   32.51 vs  32.42</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish electric equipment maker is</p>
<p>Relpol SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
